{"seq":2,"slug":"session-search-and-agent-loop","title":"Session 检索与 closed-loop agent observation","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/observability/backends-and-session-search/session-search-and-agent-loop","wordCount":1210,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"session-检索与-closed-loop-agent-observation\">Session 检索与 closed-loop agent observation</h1><p>可观测 stack 配好之后，2026 年真正区分团队成熟度的是两件事：<strong>按内容搜历史 session</strong> 与 <strong>让 agent 查自己 telemetry 修 production bug</strong>。本文讲这两块的协议层支撑、加 audit log 合规集成、最后讲 agent 自我 instrument 的反向陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>closed-loop 与传统监控的差别在于&quot;观察者就是被观察对象&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[agent 写代码] --&gt; B[部署 prod]&#10;    B --&gt; C[OTel 抓 prod error]&#10;    C --&gt; D[backend MCP server]&#10;    D --&gt; E[agent 查自己 telemetry]&#10;    E --&gt; F[agent 自动 file PR]&#10;    F --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[agent 写代码] --&gt; B[部署 prod]\n    B --&gt; C[OTel 抓 prod error]\n    C --&gt; D[backend MCP server]\n    D --&gt; E[agent 查自己 telemetry]\n    E --&gt; F[agent 自动 file PR]\n    F --&gt; A</pre><p>三个层级递进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1 session 检索</td>\n<td>按 session.id / 用户 / 时间查</td>\n<td>backend FTS 支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 内容全文搜</td>\n<td>按 prompt 关键词搜</td>\n<td>content 字段需 opt-in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 agent 闭环</td>\n<td>agent 通过 MCP 查 telemetry</td>\n<td>backend 暴露 MCP server</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"session-检索机制\">Session 检索机制</h2><p>OTel telemetry 默认把 session transcript 以 OTLP log signal 形式落 backend，按 <code>session.id</code> 做索引。要做&quot;按内容搜 session&quot;需 backend 支持全文搜索（FTS）。</p>\n<p>各 backend 对 FTS 的支持差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Backend</th>\n<th>FTS 能力</th>\n<th>实现机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Elastic</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>inverted index（默认开）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenObserve</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>full-text index on log body</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loki</td>\n<td>准 FTS</td>\n<td>LogQL <code>|= &quot;text&quot;</code> regex</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grafana Tempo</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>trace 只能按 trace_id 查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dynatrace</td>\n<td>原生</td>\n<td>DQL 全文搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>按 session 内容搜索的典型 OpenObserve 查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  attributes[&#39;session.id&#39;] AS sid,&#10;  body&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE name = &#39;gen_ai.client.prompt&#39;&#10;  AND body LIKE &#39;%refactor%&#39;&#10;  AND _timestamp &gt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;7 DAYS&#39;&#10;ORDER BY _timestamp DESC&#10;LIMIT 50;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attributes['session.id'] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'gen_ai.client.prompt'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIKE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '%refactor%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 DAYS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意前提：<strong>content 字段必须 opt-in 开启</strong>（参见 <a href=\"../otel-fundamentals/otel-and-stream-json-protocols\"><code>../1_otel-fundamentals/1_otel-and-stream-json-protocols.md</code></a> content vs structural 章节）。没开 opt-in 的团队只能按 session.id / 用户 / 时间筛选，无法按内容搜。</p>\n<p>Hermes 用 SQLite FTS5 做本地 session 检索的设计深度在 <a href=\"../../../personal-agents/persistent-memory/\"><code>../../../02_personal-agents/2_persistent-memory/</code></a> 展开——本地 first 比落 backend 更快、且不必把 prompt 推到云端，适合 PII 敏感场景。本 hub 只做引述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"closed-loop-agent-observation\">Closed-loop agent observation</h2><p>closed-loop 的 2026 关键演化：<strong>backend 把自己暴露成 MCP server</strong>，coding agent 直接通过 MCP tool 查自己 telemetry。代表实现是 OpenObserve 与 Dynatrace。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[Claude Code agent] --&gt; M[MCP transport]&#10;    M --&gt; S[OpenObserve MCP server]&#10;    S --&gt; Q[query logs/metrics/traces]&#10;    Q --&gt; R[结果回给 agent]&#10;    R --&gt; A\">flowchart TB\n    A[Claude Code agent] --&gt; M[MCP transport]\n    M --&gt; S[OpenObserve MCP server]\n    S --&gt; Q[query logs/metrics/traces]\n    Q --&gt; R[结果回给 agent]\n    R --&gt; A</pre><p>典型 MCP tool 函数签名（简化）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"@mcp_tool&#10;def query_otel_logs(&#10;    backend: str,&#10;    session_id: str | None = None,&#10;    error_filter: str | None = None,&#10;    since: str = &quot;1h&quot;,&#10;) -&gt; list[dict]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;Query OTel logs by session / error / time window.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    ...&#10;&#10;@mcp_tool&#10;def get_recent_errors(service: str, limit: int = 20) -&gt; list[dict]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;Get most recent error events from production.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@mcp_tool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> query_otel_logs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    backend: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    session_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    error_filter: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    since: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"1h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"Query OTel logs by session / error / time window.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@mcp_tool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_recent_errors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(service: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, limit: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"Get most recent error events from production.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>闭环工作流四步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>agent 完成 PR、merge、自动部署</li>\n<li>部署后 24 小时内 OTel 抓到新的 <code>gen_ai.client.event</code> error</li>\n<li>agent 起新 session、调 <code>get_recent_errors</code> MCP tool 查到自己引入的 error</li>\n<li>agent 自动 file 修复 PR（带 backlink 到原 PR + error sample）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这模式在 2026 年被 OpenObserve、Dynatrace、Honeycomb 三家先后实现。Anthropic 把&quot;MCP servers exceeded 97M downloads in 2025&quot;作为 2026 年 MCP ecosystem 成熟度的关键里程碑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Backend</th>\n<th>MCP server 状态</th>\n<th>典型 tool 数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OpenObserve</td>\n<td>内置（2026 Q1）</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dynatrace</td>\n<td>内置（2026 Q2）</td>\n<td>12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Honeycomb</td>\n<td>内置（2026 Q3）</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elastic</td>\n<td>community（2026 Q4）</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grafana</td>\n<td>实验</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"audit-log-与-compliance-集成\">Audit log 与 Compliance 集成</h2><p>合规视角下 OTel 不是孤岛——SOC2 / ISO 27001 evidence 要求覆盖 <strong>所有</strong> agent 活动，包括 web UI（claude.ai、chat.openai.com）。OTel 只抓 endpoint（CLI / IDE plugin）；web UI 活动要走 Anthropic Compliance API 独立抓。</p>\n<p>两源合并示意：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Claude Code CLI] --&gt; O[OTel telemetry]&#10;    B[Claude IDE] --&gt; O&#10;    C[claude.ai web] --&gt; P[Compliance API]&#10;    O --&gt; M[SIEM merge by user.email]&#10;    P --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; S[SOC2 evidence]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Claude Code CLI] --&gt; O[OTel telemetry]\n    B[Claude IDE] --&gt; O\n    C[claude.ai web] --&gt; P[Compliance API]\n    O --&gt; M[SIEM merge by user.email]\n    P --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; S[SOC2 evidence]</pre><p>两源差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>OTel telemetry</th>\n<th>Compliance API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>覆盖面</td>\n<td>CLI / IDE 端点</td>\n<td>web UI 活动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据形态</td>\n<td>OTLP 三信号</td>\n<td>REST event stream</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时性</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>分钟级（批量推送）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pull / Push</td>\n<td>push 到 Collector</td>\n<td>pull from API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启用方式</td>\n<td>env var</td>\n<td>org admin 开通</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合并策略：<strong>SIEM 按 user.email + timestamp 做 join</strong>，把同一用户的端点活动与 web 活动串起来。SIEM 选 Splunk / Sumo Logic / Datadog Security 都行。</p>\n<p>实际 evidence 包至少包含三类：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>agent 运行 audit log（OTel）：哪个用户、哪个时间、调了哪个 tool</li>\n<li>web UI audit log（Compliance API）：claude.ai 上发过什么 message</li>\n<li>permission change log：managed-settings.json 变更历史（git log 即可）</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"agent-自我-instrument-的反向陷阱\">Agent 自我 instrument 的反向陷阱</h2><p>closed-loop 模式下，agent 经常被要求&quot;给我加 OTel instrumentation&quot;——LLM 写 OTel SDK 代码非常容易踩坑。</p>\n<p>最常见的陷阱：<strong>把 user ID / session ID / prompt ID 当 metric label</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 错误：cardinality 爆炸&#10;counter = meter.create_counter(&quot;requests_total&quot;)&#10;counter.add(1, attributes={&quot;user_email&quot;: user.email, &quot;session_id&quot;: sid})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 错误：cardinality 爆炸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meter.create_counter(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"requests_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.add(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attributes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: user.email, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: sid})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>OTel metric label 的 cardinality 上限通常是几千；每个独立 user_email 是一条独立时间序列，10 万用户的话直接打爆 Prometheus 内存。</p>\n<p>正确做法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# user 维度放 log event 或 resource attribute，不放 metric label&#10;counter = meter.create_counter(&quot;requests_total&quot;)&#10;counter.add(1, attributes={&quot;model&quot;: &quot;claude-sonnet-4-7&quot;})  # 低 cardinality&#10;logger.emit({&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;gen_ai.client.api_request&quot;,&#10;    &quot;attributes&quot;: {&quot;user.email&quot;: user.email, &quot;session.id&quot;: sid},&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># user 维度放 log event 或 resource attribute，不放 metric label</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> meter.create_counter(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"requests_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.add(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">attributes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-sonnet-4-7\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 低 cardinality</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logger.emit({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gen_ai.client.api_request\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"attributes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user.email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: user.email, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"session.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: sid},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四条 cardinality 安全规则：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>metric label 安全？</th>\n<th>替代位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>user.email</td>\n<td>否（高）</td>\n<td>log attribute / resource</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>session.id</td>\n<td>否（高）</td>\n<td>log attribute</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>model 名</td>\n<td>是（低，约 20）</td>\n<td>metric label OK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tool 名</td>\n<td>是（低，约 50）</td>\n<td>metric label OK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP status</td>\n<td>是（低，约 10）</td>\n<td>metric label OK</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>防御措施：在项目里装一份 <strong>OTel-specific skill 或 hook</strong>，agent 写 OTel 代码时静态扫 metric label cardinality；或 backend 端配 cardinality limiter（Prometheus 2.45+ 内置）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>以为 OTel 默认能搜 prompt 内容</strong>：默认 content 不记，搜不到；先开 opt-in 再回填历史搜不了</li>\n<li><strong>MCP server 暴露生产 backend 没加 auth</strong>：agent 能查也能改，安全风险大；MCP transport 必须配 token</li>\n<li><strong>SIEM join 没对 user.email 做规范化</strong>：<a href=\"mailto:alice@acme.com\">alice@acme.com</a> 与 <a href=\"mailto:alice@acme.com\">Alice@acme.com</a> 算两个用户</li>\n<li><strong>Compliance API 拉取漏了 web UI 活动</strong>：合规审计被打回；定期 reconcile OTel 与 Compliance API 总量</li>\n<li><strong>agent 写 OTel 时把 PII 直接放 metric label</strong>：cardinality 爆炸 + GDPR 违规；review 必查</li>\n<li><strong>session 检索没按 retention 删数据</strong>：GDPR 七天删除请求达不到；retention policy 默认要配</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>session 检索按内容搜需 backend 支持 FTS + content 字段 opt-in</li>\n<li>Hermes 本地 FTS5 路径在 personal-agents-modules 章节展开</li>\n<li>closed-loop：backend 暴露 MCP server，agent 自己查 telemetry 修 bug</li>\n<li>OpenObserve / Dynatrace / Honeycomb 三家 2026 年都内置 MCP server</li>\n<li>SOC2 evidence = OTel + Compliance API + permission change log 三源</li>\n<li>agent 写 OTel 易把 user ID 当 metric label，需 skill / hook 拦截</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Backend 选型回看 <a href=\"backend-comparison\"><code>./1_backend-comparison.md</code></a>。本地 session 检索深度见 <a href=\"../../../personal-agents/persistent-memory/\"><code>../../../02_personal-agents/2_persistent-memory/</code></a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Session 检索与 closed-loop agent observation","id":"session-检索与-closed-loop-agent-observation"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Session 检索机制","id":"session-检索机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Closed-loop agent observation","id":"closed-loop-agent-observation"},{"level":2,"text":"Audit log 与 Compliance 集成","id":"audit-log-与-compliance-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Agent 自我 instrument 的反向陷阱","id":"agent-自我-instrument-的反向陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Backend 横向比较与典型部署组合","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/observability/backends-and-session-search/backend-comparison"},"next":null}